    "summary": "The user is inquiring about the moderation boundaries between political satire and hate speech, specifically questioning whether \"impact-based\" moderation standards allow platforms to silence controversial political viewpoints. The assistant responds by explaining industry standards, distinguishing between mere offense and systematic dehumanization, and maintaining a neutral, descriptive stance on how platforms navigate these tensions.",
